WEBVTT

00:29.995 --> 00:34.031
(Azure Spring)

00:34.032 --> 00:36.667
(All characters, places, events, etc. depicted are fictional.)

00:36.668 --> 00:39.037
(Children and animals were filmed under strict guidelines.)

01:01.993 --> 01:02.994
So?

01:03.495 --> 01:06.431
Any thoughts after your first harvest, baby free diver?

01:10.035 --> 01:11.535
I loved it.

01:11.536 --> 01:13.536
So much so that I couldn't think of anything else.

01:16.341 --> 01:18.376
Didn't you like it a lot?

01:19.010 --> 01:20.011
What?

01:20.712 --> 01:22.379
She felt so good...

01:22.380 --> 01:25.550
that she took back calling me rude and even said I was like the sea.

01:26.284 --> 01:29.020
What? The sea?

01:29.487 --> 01:31.722
Darn it. Were you flirting with him?

01:31.723 --> 01:33.091
You said you weren't interested!

01:33.391 --> 01:36.026
What? Wait. No way!

01:36.027 --> 01:37.429
I never said...

01:38.496 --> 01:39.930
Keep it quiet.

01:39.931 --> 01:41.166
What's going on?

01:43.001 --> 01:44.102
Did you just smile?

01:44.369 --> 01:46.370
Hey!

01:46.371 --> 01:48.073
Where do you think you're going? Sit down.

01:48.440 --> 01:51.108
- What is really going on? - I swear.

01:51.109 --> 01:53.478
It wasn't like that.

01:54.012 --> 01:56.181
If it wasn't that, then what was it?

01:56.815 --> 01:58.016
Jeez.

01:58.517 --> 02:00.818
You're smiling? Did you just smile?

02:00.819 --> 02:03.221
I loved that the sea was there.

02:08.793 --> 02:11.996
Nothing's going on. I mean it.

02:11.997 --> 02:14.399
Why are you doing this to me?

02:14.666 --> 02:17.469
- So what's going on? - Nothing!

02:17.869 --> 02:18.970
Did you just smile?

02:20.939 --> 02:23.375
- I'm done. - Come on.

02:29.915 --> 02:32.050
(Jung Gi Tae)

02:49.134 --> 02:52.137
(Republic of Korea Army Park Jae Hui)

03:07.786 --> 03:13.792
(Episode 4: Secret of the Deep Sea)

03:17.362 --> 03:18.363
Excuse...

03:19.664 --> 03:21.399
Hey, you call him out.

03:23.935 --> 03:27.005
Duk Hyun, dinner's ready. Come on out.

03:38.450 --> 03:39.451
Sit over here.

03:46.791 --> 03:48.293
I don't eat anything raw.

03:49.327 --> 03:52.931
What? You're a free diver. How can you not eat raw seafood?

03:54.065 --> 03:55.900
Eating seafood raw can expose you...

03:55.901 --> 03:58.021
- to parasites and bacterial infections... - Open up.

04:00.338 --> 04:01.540
Chew on it.

04:02.274 --> 04:04.776
You'll taste more of the ocean than when it's boiled.

04:17.556 --> 04:18.723
Well, it is dangerous...

04:20.659 --> 04:23.328
because it's so good and could get you addicted.

04:24.129 --> 04:25.130
Right?

04:27.365 --> 04:31.469
Try a piece of turban snail. It's chewy and tender.

04:47.586 --> 04:49.287
Yes, it's good.

04:51.890 --> 04:53.491
- Cheers. - Cheers.

05:00.765 --> 05:01.800
Duk Hyun.

05:04.069 --> 05:05.704
I look flushed, don't I?

05:08.373 --> 05:10.475
But why do you talk to him like he's older than you?

05:11.443 --> 05:12.803
You don't even know how old he is.

05:12.944 --> 05:14.212
Because...

05:15.013 --> 05:16.882
he's good-looking.

05:18.149 --> 05:22.020
Then should everyone who's ugly be considered younger?

05:28.126 --> 05:30.161
Hey, now that you're considered younger than me,

05:30.829 --> 05:32.264
let me ask you this.

05:33.865 --> 05:35.467
My dear younger friend,

05:36.535 --> 05:37.775
why did you become a free diver?

05:45.810 --> 05:46.811
Because I can...

05:48.213 --> 05:49.514
be alone.

05:54.085 --> 05:55.187
I must be alone.

05:55.754 --> 05:56.922
That's why I harvest seafood.

06:00.926 --> 06:01.993
It was unexpected.

06:03.361 --> 06:05.263
I thought I had a grasp of who he was.

06:07.032 --> 06:09.801
A lonely man's elegant hobby.

06:14.806 --> 06:16.308
That's way too sexy.

06:17.042 --> 06:19.611
He's so fatally charming.

06:20.011 --> 06:22.180
Hey. Go home, Su Jeong.

06:22.547 --> 06:23.548
You're drunk.

06:25.851 --> 06:28.019
It's way too late for me to go home alone.

06:29.154 --> 06:31.288
- Can you walk me home... - Have a safe walk back.

06:31.289 --> 06:32.891
What? Duk Hyun...

06:35.627 --> 06:36.995
Wait, Duk Hyun!

06:38.897 --> 06:40.498
He may be much darker and deeper,

06:41.266 --> 06:42.434
just like...

06:43.068 --> 06:44.536
the deep sea.

06:52.410 --> 06:53.578
Jeez.

06:54.012 --> 06:57.015
I wanted to walk home with Duk Hyun.

06:57.716 --> 06:59.996
Why are you interested in someone you know nothing about?

07:00.652 --> 07:02.287
What if he's dangerous?

07:03.121 --> 07:04.990
I've known him for three years now.

07:05.257 --> 07:08.859
He's been quietly harvesting food not for one or two years,

07:08.860 --> 07:11.396
but three whole years. No way he's dangerous.

07:11.830 --> 07:15.367
That's why all the rumours have disappeared.

07:16.001 --> 07:17.802
There were rumours about him?

07:18.370 --> 07:19.971
So many of them.

07:20.305 --> 07:22.440
Some said he was an agent who left in disgrace,

07:22.841 --> 07:24.801
others that he was a murderer just out of prison,

07:25.076 --> 07:28.613
or a hidden child of a conglomerate family, and many more.

07:29.147 --> 07:33.251
At first, he was an extremely suspicious man.

07:33.919 --> 07:34.986
But now...

07:39.224 --> 07:40.258
Suspicious.

07:47.265 --> 07:48.333
He seems...

07:50.468 --> 07:51.469
very suspicious.

07:51.903 --> 07:52.904
Yes.

08:02.147 --> 08:03.447
- Who is that? - Darn it.

08:03.448 --> 08:04.949
I've never seen him before.

08:04.950 --> 08:05.951
Jeez.

08:10.121 --> 08:11.756
No, don't go. Watch out.

08:17.796 --> 08:20.632
Darn it. Where is it?

08:24.503 --> 08:25.604
Jeez.

08:54.165 --> 08:56.801
Did he start a family with a free diver, or did he become one?

08:57.102 --> 08:58.136
What the heck?

09:26.231 --> 09:27.511
What's he going to do with that?

09:28.366 --> 09:29.534
Wait, is he...

09:30.635 --> 09:31.803
a robber?

09:32.103 --> 09:36.174
- No way. - Where are you, Yoon Duk Hyun?

09:38.410 --> 09:39.444
No!

09:39.678 --> 09:40.779
Hey, be quiet.

09:42.514 --> 09:43.615
He must be...

09:44.249 --> 09:46.785
someone who holds a grudge against Duk Hyun.

09:47.819 --> 09:50.589
I think he's here to kill him. What do we do?

09:51.122 --> 09:52.424
What are we going to do?

09:53.158 --> 09:54.292
What now?

09:56.428 --> 09:57.529
Hey, you punk!

10:01.066 --> 10:02.200
Who the heck are you?

10:03.335 --> 10:05.170
Get out of my place!

10:06.972 --> 10:09.040
- My goodness. - You!

10:09.941 --> 10:10.976
What the heck?

10:16.314 --> 10:17.315
What on earth?

10:19.918 --> 10:21.186
Seo An Na!

10:23.655 --> 10:24.923
An Na!

10:38.103 --> 10:39.137
You're up.

10:40.105 --> 10:42.107
What happened?

10:42.541 --> 10:44.341
I thought you had fainted after falling,

10:44.342 --> 10:46.182
but you began to snore, so I moved you inside.

10:47.979 --> 10:49.247
Oh, thanks.

10:50.615 --> 10:53.450
But a suspicious guy grabbed a hook,

10:53.451 --> 10:55.387
- trying to kill... - Are you talking about me?

10:56.655 --> 10:58.223
Yes, I'm talking about him!

11:00.825 --> 11:02.427
I warned you. Get lost.

11:03.695 --> 11:07.599
I wouldn't be here now if I were scared of your warning.

11:11.336 --> 11:13.003
Are you two acquainted?

11:13.004 --> 11:14.172
- No. - Yes.

11:14.739 --> 11:15.740
Excuse me?

11:16.775 --> 11:19.444
We are acquainted. He's just pouting.

11:20.679 --> 11:24.683
Anyway, why do you keep talking casually with me?

11:25.217 --> 11:27.052
What? Are you older than me?

11:29.621 --> 11:30.622
It looks like it.

11:33.625 --> 11:35.460
Yes, I'm older. So what?

11:36.528 --> 11:38.663
I'm casual with anyone within a ten-year age gap.

11:43.168 --> 11:45.269
Why do you do that, hiding on an island like this?

11:45.270 --> 11:46.371
Mind your own business.

11:47.072 --> 11:48.240
"Mind your own business."

11:48.940 --> 11:51.208
Why? Do you want to get better at diving...

11:51.209 --> 11:52.777
and flee overseas?

11:53.812 --> 11:55.146
Learn to drive a ship instead.

11:57.482 --> 11:58.483
"Flee"?

11:58.783 --> 11:59.985
You didn't know?

12:00.986 --> 12:03.188
He came here to avoid me and...

12:04.823 --> 12:05.857
Enough is enough.

12:09.961 --> 12:11.801
Aren't you going to grab your harvesting gear?

12:12.030 --> 12:13.031
Me?

12:13.231 --> 12:14.633
Were you going to quit after a day?

12:15.433 --> 12:16.468
Whatever suits you.

12:17.903 --> 12:19.905
Why is he taking this out on me?

12:20.338 --> 12:21.540
Hey, wait up!

12:36.555 --> 12:39.357
Did you do something wrong where you came from?

12:39.925 --> 12:41.358
He said you fled, so I just...

12:41.359 --> 12:42.427
Do I seem different now?

12:42.994 --> 12:44.062
It's kind of odd.

12:44.596 --> 12:46.398
And I got curious, too.

12:52.070 --> 12:53.671
Who I was or what I did doesn't change...

12:53.672 --> 12:56.474
the fact that I'm your tenant and diving teacher.

12:58.476 --> 13:00.879
Well, that's true.

13:01.079 --> 13:02.113
Then let's hurry.

13:02.814 --> 13:04.382
We have to go far today to get oysters.

13:09.721 --> 13:11.756
Does simply knowing someone through and through...

13:12.891 --> 13:14.092
create trust?

13:27.672 --> 13:28.807
If that were the case,

13:30.108 --> 13:31.810
I would've had faith in myself first.

13:37.582 --> 13:39.851
You can start again now.

13:47.225 --> 13:48.226
Trust...

13:49.327 --> 13:50.862
does not come from knowledge.

13:53.965 --> 13:55.734
Maybe the reason I chase after him...

13:56.568 --> 13:59.171
is to find out when that trust will come.

14:02.207 --> 14:03.208
Oysters?

14:03.842 --> 14:06.845
He can find oysters in the middle of summer?

14:09.614 --> 14:10.749
Wait up!

14:24.663 --> 14:26.131
We have to get on a boat?

14:39.477 --> 14:41.046
I'm here, Duk Hyun!

14:42.380 --> 14:44.916
- What's going on? - Are you coming too, Su Jeong?

14:45.250 --> 14:47.352
I'd follow Duk Hyun anywhere.

14:49.020 --> 14:50.388
Everybody is here now.

14:50.856 --> 14:52.357
Dad, we're good to go!

14:54.492 --> 14:56.862
Hang on tightly. We're off!

14:57.996 --> 14:59.030
Wait!

15:04.369 --> 15:06.338
Are you coming, too?

15:08.039 --> 15:09.040
We're friends after all.

15:21.453 --> 15:22.687
Let's go!

16:14.573 --> 16:16.274
How far are we going?

16:17.375 --> 16:18.410
We're almost there.

16:20.779 --> 16:22.214
I can't do this anymore.

16:50.175 --> 16:52.335
The Black Snake Unit's Water Ghost still got his game.

16:56.181 --> 16:57.215
Duk Hyun,

16:57.649 --> 16:58.984
I'm dizzy.

17:00.585 --> 17:01.853
We have to get to that side.

17:02.721 --> 17:04.322
What? No way...

17:40.292 --> 17:41.293
Oh, gosh.

17:46.264 --> 17:47.265
An Na.

17:48.466 --> 17:51.703
Doesn't Duk Hyun seem suspicious?

17:53.338 --> 17:55.340
Didn't you call him sexy and mysterious before?

17:55.740 --> 17:56.975
It's not that.

17:57.876 --> 18:00.645
Ever since that new guy came,

18:01.146 --> 18:03.181
his face hasn't been the same.

18:03.515 --> 18:04.916
I can tell just by looking at him.

18:10.021 --> 18:11.056
Maybe you're right.

18:12.657 --> 18:13.925
I'm telling you.

18:14.860 --> 18:15.961
Something's fishy.

18:46.391 --> 18:47.392
What's going on?

18:59.538 --> 19:00.539
Is this it?

19:01.206 --> 19:02.406
Is this where the oysters are?

19:05.277 --> 19:07.445
We must cross over to that island to harvest oysters.

19:11.917 --> 19:13.118
But this is the sea.

19:13.552 --> 19:15.353
How are we going to get there?

19:17.155 --> 19:19.858
If we wait, the sea will open a path for us.

19:20.792 --> 19:23.528
Jeez, are we waiting for the miracle of Moses?

19:24.796 --> 19:26.097
Enough with your nonsense.

19:26.731 --> 19:27.732
Hey.

19:29.267 --> 19:30.735
Let's go over there and look around.

19:32.404 --> 19:35.973
What? But I want to stay here.

19:35.974 --> 19:36.975
Come.

19:37.275 --> 19:38.577
Duk Hyun...

20:07.272 --> 20:08.540
How's your shoulder?

20:10.175 --> 20:11.276
How did you know?

20:13.612 --> 20:17.015
You said it in your sleep at the public clinic last time...

20:18.917 --> 20:22.187
that your shoulder is fully healed, but you don't think you can swim again.

20:26.358 --> 20:27.492
Oh, gosh.

20:33.231 --> 20:34.299
You're right.

20:35.867 --> 20:36.968
To be honest,

20:38.336 --> 20:39.538
I'm not unwell.

20:42.107 --> 20:43.875
I was fine while harvesting seafood,

20:45.777 --> 20:46.857
and even the doctor said...

20:47.579 --> 20:49.681
I could go back to swimming ages ago.

20:53.818 --> 20:56.288
- I know, but... - But faith...

20:57.722 --> 20:59.224
doesn't come from knowledge.

21:04.396 --> 21:05.397
Then...

21:07.365 --> 21:08.533
what can I do...

21:10.001 --> 21:11.736
to have faith in myself?

21:17.576 --> 21:19.411
Give yourself time...

21:21.713 --> 21:23.648
until you can learn to trust yourself again.

21:28.753 --> 21:29.788
All things...

21:30.288 --> 21:31.656
need time.

21:45.036 --> 21:46.137
It opened up.

21:48.373 --> 21:50.842
The sea opened up!

22:17.202 --> 22:19.237
What? It really...

22:20.238 --> 22:21.239
opened up.

22:24.576 --> 22:25.577
Let's go.

22:29.181 --> 22:30.282
- Let's go. - Okay.

23:00.378 --> 23:01.658
(Parang-ri Haenyeo Cho Mi Hyeon)

23:09.120 --> 23:11.890
The sea will be different from the one we dived in last time.

23:17.996 --> 23:18.997
I can tell.

23:19.731 --> 23:21.099
It must be quite deep.

23:21.933 --> 23:23.268
It's very deep and dark.

23:24.836 --> 23:25.837
Stick out your hand.

23:31.743 --> 23:33.345
That's how far you can see.

23:34.713 --> 23:35.814
Then...

23:36.348 --> 23:37.749
how do you harvest seafood?

23:39.384 --> 23:40.385
By faith.

23:43.088 --> 23:44.648
Trust the training you've had so far...

23:45.690 --> 23:46.725
and...

23:47.325 --> 23:49.461
the memories from your previous diving experiences.

25:37.369 --> 25:38.370
But...

25:39.204 --> 25:40.705
can we really find oysters here?

25:55.720 --> 25:59.124
Rock oysters only live in the far and deep sea.

26:03.962 --> 26:05.864
Is it like a legend?

26:08.800 --> 26:13.071
I wouldn't call it a legend, but more like a dream.

26:14.306 --> 26:15.407
The dream of free divers.

26:20.579 --> 26:23.281
Is there a difference between the two?

26:25.550 --> 26:26.618
A dream...

26:30.121 --> 26:32.123
can come true, as long as you believe in it.

26:58.416 --> 27:01.820
Faith does not come from knowledge.

27:48.233 --> 27:49.234
Perhaps faith...

27:50.302 --> 27:51.870
is born out of uncertainty.

28:32.611 --> 28:34.091
- Thank you for the food! - Enjoy it!

28:34.779 --> 28:36.648
All right. Cheers!

28:39.784 --> 28:40.986
Come on, Duk Hyun.

28:41.419 --> 28:43.822
One more time. Cheers.

28:46.491 --> 28:47.592
- Cheers. - Cheers.

28:56.434 --> 28:57.936
These look so good.

29:14.152 --> 29:15.220
How long...

29:16.188 --> 29:17.923
do you plan to stay?

29:18.590 --> 29:19.591
Well,

29:20.058 --> 29:21.259
until my business is done.

29:22.093 --> 29:23.195
Exactly.

29:23.628 --> 29:25.597
What's this business of yours?

29:27.132 --> 29:29.133
Duk Hyun must have...

29:29.134 --> 29:32.337
stolen your girlfriend, new guy.

29:33.705 --> 29:36.408
The war of love.

29:37.809 --> 29:39.878
I guess it's similar.

29:40.512 --> 29:43.081
What? Is that really the issue?

29:46.518 --> 29:48.053
This punk, Yoon Duk Hyun,

29:51.890 --> 29:54.159
did take something very precious from me.

30:04.202 --> 30:05.570
I'm calling it a night.

30:06.638 --> 30:08.173
Wait, Duk Hyun.

30:15.981 --> 30:17.682
New guy, you just made this...

30:18.783 --> 30:19.918
so boring.

30:20.452 --> 30:21.453
What now?

30:22.687 --> 30:23.688
So?

30:24.422 --> 30:26.057
What did he take from you?

30:28.293 --> 30:29.327
Do you want to know?

30:37.636 --> 30:40.105
- It's a secret. - Darn it.

30:41.373 --> 30:42.440
Drink as a penalty.

30:43.642 --> 30:45.576
Chug it down. You have to drink it in one go.

30:45.577 --> 30:47.912
- How am I going to do that? - Bottoms up!

30:47.913 --> 30:49.681
You're so tacky.

30:49.848 --> 30:51.348
Your hair's worse.

30:51.349 --> 30:54.085
- Cheers! - Darn it. What do you know about hairstyles?

31:15.841 --> 31:19.110
Man, that stubborn punk.

31:26.251 --> 31:29.120
Is he seriously harvesting oysters in the middle of summer?

31:36.328 --> 31:39.631
You must be thinking I'd leave after you wear me out.

31:41.366 --> 31:42.534
But that won't happen.

31:44.236 --> 31:46.171
Why are you so obsessed with me?

31:48.473 --> 31:49.474
I don't know.

31:50.308 --> 31:53.211
I forgot the reason after three years of chasing.

31:54.412 --> 31:57.015
All I want to do is grab you and take you with me.

31:59.217 --> 32:00.352
I feel the same way.

32:02.320 --> 32:03.622
You asked why I'm doing this,

32:04.489 --> 32:06.057
hiding on an island like this.

32:11.830 --> 32:15.000
I started because I thought that after three years,

32:17.435 --> 32:19.271
I might forget why I began.

32:25.343 --> 32:26.811
But it hasn't worked for me yet.

33:01.847 --> 33:03.381
Hey, Duk Hyun.

33:05.584 --> 33:06.618
Are you asleep?

33:08.753 --> 33:11.056
Stop pretending like you're asleep.

33:14.826 --> 33:16.094
About Jae Hui.

33:18.797 --> 33:19.865
We may...

33:23.134 --> 33:24.202
never get to see...

33:25.537 --> 33:26.938
Jae Hui again.

33:31.943 --> 33:33.111
So...

33:35.647 --> 33:37.749
you should stop doing this.

33:41.486 --> 33:43.989
Come with me to see Jae Hui. Please!

33:47.759 --> 33:48.927
What was that?

33:49.694 --> 33:51.263
Why is he screaming?

34:04.409 --> 34:08.246
Darn it. Doing this here won't bring back...

34:12.717 --> 34:14.586
that punk you killed.

34:18.423 --> 34:19.457
So...

34:20.458 --> 34:21.793
it's time to stop this.

34:23.595 --> 34:25.263
Come back with me.

34:28.400 --> 34:29.401
Please?

34:33.772 --> 34:34.973
Darn it.

34:41.146 --> 34:42.314
That guy...

34:44.883 --> 34:46.651
killed someone?

34:59.865 --> 35:00.866
Darn it.
